<p class="kicker">A Fibonacci poem regarding yet another war in my lifetime</p>
<p class="byline">Dave Mitchner</p>
<p class="meta">Written February 28, 2026 • Originally published: {{ originallyPublished }}</p>


<br>War.
<br>Why?
<br>Again
<br>Smedley said -
<br>"It is a racket!"
<br>The rich must profit
<br>But avoid
<br>Self risk
<br>For
<br>Cash.
<p>

